{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Diogenes is back, but this time the real threat comes from beyond the stars: an alien invasion seeking to conquer the Earth. The Basureroes must prepare to spring into action and save the world. Once again, it's time to take out the trash! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955850/extras/c6c242471a074e609df9bc58265df66c.poster.avif?t=1765481190\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955850/extras/c6c242471a074e609df9bc58265df66c.webm?t=1765481190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955850/extras/c6c242471a074e609df9bc58265df66c.mp4?t=1765481190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cBasureroes: Invasion\u201d</strong> is a 2D platform game with retro aesthetics in which a group of heroes with different abilities must save the world from an alien invasion. Run, jump and fight your way through twenty levels full of danger and epic boss fights.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955850/extras/69561ed210c17493a4f2102b5ea72ebc.poster.avif?t=1765481190\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955850/extras/69561ed210c17493a4f2102b5ea72ebc.webm?t=1765481190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955850/extras/69561ed210c17493a4f2102b5ea72ebc.mp4?t=1765481190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro visual style that pays homage to the classic action platformers of yesteryear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise control and gameplay adapted to current times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six different game modes will unlock as you progress: story, time attack, battle, boss rush, survival, and training. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing difficulty (not everything is going to be a walk around the city!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack with more than thirty different themes, with a retro but modern touch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endearing characters and light narrative in a science fiction and superhero story for all audiences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A group of heroes with different abilities: running, jumping and sliding is just the beginning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A score of levels full of enemies and obstacles with varied environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An epic battle against a final boss awaits at the end of each level </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five people and a little lost puppy are waiting to be saved in (almost) each level. Only our h\u00e9roes can do it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some special levels: pilot a spaceship, drive a motorcycle or control a mine cart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local cooperative multiplayer mode for up to four players</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955850/extras/26b39a016bb8e72192b0d8870d6adb66.poster.avif?t=1765481190\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955850/extras/26b39a016bb8e72192b0d8870d6adb66.webm?t=1765481190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955850/extras/26b39a016bb8e72192b0d8870d6adb66.mp4?t=1765481190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The invasion starts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1955850/dd24061cc6b8b0b9a78a2c4f6cd3461466b15029.jpg"},{"name":"That's no way to make friends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1955850/e36cd0bda093e07427853e2fb130b811e0829472.jpg"},{"name":"Masked versus Dark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1955850/4f6a8573cfa1bc13f721dfd5974f6ce81fe5cff5.jpg"},{"name":"We've already finished?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1955850/cb5471b58116e51ad8e8eb5c5dc8acc9702aa4ea.jpg"},{"name":"Labyrinth Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1955850/d9307a3e44cdaccfdcccf91cf305ef854ebadaf7.jpg"},{"name":"Excess baggage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1955850/181dfc7525a387af2916891ba0937436af9bb175.jpg"},{"name":"Main team reunited","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1955850/55c46cdd5960536129759a127f7d281ce33624fe.jpg"},{"name":"Heroes from the past","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1955850/994a1d403354d71b335c1ebbfb44a830da96cae0.jpg"},{"name":"New recruits","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1955850/e86f08d567d4df1909de6bb3b95c560b264b194f.jpg"},{"name":"Second round","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1955850/789039ec02eafab759105862071790167c2ea27e.jpg"}],"total":36},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1955850?t=1765481190","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955850/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765481190","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955850/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765481190","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955850/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765481190","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2092360,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Diogenes is back, but this time the real threat comes from beyond the stars: an alien invasion seeking to conquer the Earth. The Basureroes must prepare to spring into action and save the world. Once again, it's time to take out the trash! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955850/extras/c6c242471a074e609df9bc58265df66c.poster.avif?t=1765481190\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955850/extras/c6c242471a074e609df9bc58265df66c.webm?t=1765481190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955850/extras/c6c242471a074e609df9bc58265df66c.mp4?t=1765481190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cBasureroes: Invasion\u2