ass=\"bb_paragraph\" >An epic battle against a final boss awaits at the end of each level </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five people and a little lost puppy are waiting to be saved in (almost) each level. Only our h\u00e9roes can do it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some special levels: pilot a spaceship, drive a motorcycle or control a mine cart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local cooperative multiplayer mode for up to four players</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955850/extras/26b39a016bb8e72192b0d8870d6adb66.poster.avif?t=1765481190\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955850/extras/26b39a016bb8e72192b0d8870d6adb66.webm?t=1765481190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955850/extras/26b39a016bb8e72192b0d8870d6adb66.mp4?t=1765481190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Javs Game Studios"],"dlc":[3447520],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955850/header.jpg?t=1765481190","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Javs Game Studios","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1955850/1809577187/0178a56cfc5bb804559a45808a85be9857c7f175/1763135192/dash_av1.mpd?t=17631